    "All garage geometry and assembly details",
    "Concrete colour and roughness textures",
    "Diagnostic graphics and service markings",
    "Rose Velocity original rose/magenta/plum wall mural, hand-authored SVG and seeded aerosol/porosity texture",
    "Complete front entrance and personnel door, ceiling, side returns, service panelling, original wall-mounted electrical/ventilation/cable details and tier-specific architectural progression",
    "Distinct reverse arrival zone: charging pedestal and tethered connectors, real intake/extraction ducting, entry gate motor and manual chain, flush entrance lane/drain markings and progressive filtered air utilities",
